          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬೀದಿ (bīdi) comes from Sanskrit vīthi, \"road, street; line, row\", reshaped to Kannada sounds: a tadbhava (CDIAL 12050). The Sanskrit v- became Kannada b-."
            }
          ]
        },
